---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/shared/Container.astro";
import Title from "../components/shared/Title.astro";
import Paragraph from "../components/shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Pagebreadcrumb from "../components/shared/Pagebreadcrumb.astro";

import {
  FolderKanban,
  ShieldCheck,
  Cloud,
  Users,
  FileCheck2,
  Workflow,
  BadgeCheck,
  LockKeyhole,
} from "lucide-astro";

import Requirement from "../components/sections/Requirement.astro";
import Selar from "../components/sections/Selar.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cloudnova - M365 Bootcamp - Week 3">
  <main class="flex flex-col gap-y-16 md:gap-y-24 overflow-hidden">
    <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background Effects -->
      <div
        class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[25rem] w-[25rem] rounded-full bg-green-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>

      <Container className="relative z-10">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <span
            class="inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          rounded-full
          border
          border-cyan-500/20
          bg-cyan-500/10
          px-5
          py-2
          text-sm
          font-medium
          text-cyan-700
          dark:text-cyan-300
          backdrop-blur-xl"
          >
            <BadgeCheck size={18} />
            Week 3 Curriculum
          </span>

          <h1
            class="mt-8
          text-5xl/tight
          md:text-6xl/tight
          font-bold
          tracking-tight
          text-heading-1"
          >
            SharePoint &
            <span
              class="text-transparent
            bg-clip-text
            bg-gradient-to-r
            from-cyan-500
            via-primary
            to-green-500"
            >
              OneDrive
            </span>
          </h1>

          <Paragraph className="mt-8 text-lg">
            Week 3 introduces students to SharePoint Online and OneDrive
            administration. Students will learn how organizations manage
            collaboration, file storage, permissions, governance, and secure
            document sharing in Microsoft 365 environments.
          </Paragraph>

          <Pagebreadcrumb active="weekthree" />
        </div>

        <!-- Grid -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-20">
          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-cyan-500
              to-blue-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <FolderKanban size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>SharePoint Sites & Permissions</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how SharePoint sites are structured and how
              organizations use them for collaboration, communication, and
              document storage. This section also covers permissions, groups,
              access management, and inheritance.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sharepoint/introduction"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              SharePoint Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-indigo-500
              to-purple-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <FileCheck2 size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Document Management & Governance</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how businesses organize and manage documents in SharePoint.
              Students will understand version control, metadata, retention
              policies, document lifecycle management, and governance best
              practices.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sharepoint/governance-overview"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Governance Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-green-500
              to-emerald-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Cloud size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>SharePoint & OneDrive Administration</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how administrators manage SharePoint Online
              and OneDrive settings across organizations. Topics include storage
              management, user access, external sharing, admin centers, and
              organizational controls.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sharepoint/sharepoint-admin-role"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              SharePoint Admin Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-orange-400
              to-yellow-400
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Users size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Sharing & Collaboration</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how users collaborate securely using SharePoint and
              OneDrive. Students will understand internal and external sharing,
              collaboration permissions, guest access, and how organizations
              balance productivity with security.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sharepoint/external-sharing-overview"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Sharing & Collaboration Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-red-500
              to-orange-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <ShieldCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Security, Compliance & Sync</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how organizations secure files and
              collaboration environments. Topics include sensitivity labels, DLP
              basics, OneDrive sync, compliance controls, and protecting company
              data across devices.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sharepoint/security-for-sharepoint-and-onedrive"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Security & Compliance Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-slate-700
              to-slate-900
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <Workflow size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Automation & Real-world Scenarios</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will be introduced to SharePoint and OneDrive automation
              concepts. This includes basic workflows, approval processes,
              document automation, and real-world administrative scenarios
              commonly encountered in enterprise environments.
            </Paragraph>

            <Paragraph className="mt-4">
              Practical examples will help students understand how businesses
              use Microsoft 365 collaboration tools daily.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-automate/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Power Automate Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Bonus -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl lg:col-span-2"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14
              h-14
              rounded-2xl
              bg-gradient-to-br
              from-primary
              to-cyan-500
              text-white
              flex
              items-center
              justify-center"
              >
                <LockKeyhole size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>What Students Will Achieve</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              By the end of Week 3, students will understand how modern
              organizations use SharePoint Online and OneDrive to manage
              collaboration, file storage, governance, security, and enterprise
              productivity workflows.
            </Paragraph>
          </div>
        </div>

        <Selar />
        <div class="pt-10">
          <Requirement />
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
